## Lessons Learned

### Loading
1. Metadata extraction is crucial for debugging retrieval issues
2. Binary file detection prevents garbage data in corpus

### Chunking
1. Chunk size is a trade-off: precision vs context
2. Overlap prevents hard cuts at boundaries
3. (More to come after remaining lessons)

